tems and beyond. Manage public and shielded assets on your terms, with built-in learning tools to support you every step of the way.</span></p><div class="sc-f6398f53-0 fUUkqb"><button data-isbusy="false" class="sc-a6d0878a-0 sc-a6d0878a-1 sc-a6d0878a-2 sc-8ccea415-0 jWxsaX jmLbB cYaeMm VIMCQ"><span class="sc-412f876f-0 oHuZJ">Add  to Desktop</span><span class="sc-8ccea415-1 fiyoYV"><img alt="The Chrome browser logo" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="cursor-default" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Ftnb8oobx%2Fproduction%2F6e11c5049ea3ae633c8a30f2aaa36e52fc89cf16-64x64.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Ftnb8oobx%2Fproduction%2F6e11c5049ea3ae633c8a30f2aaa36e52fc89cf16-64x64.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Ftnb8oobx%2Fproduction%2F6e11c5049ea3ae633c8a30f2aaa36e52fc89cf16-64x64.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/></span></button></div></div></div></section><section data-step="1" class="sc-ca3518c7-0 azwYR"><div class="sc-e53b9cc9-0 sc-ca3518c7-1 iQlomH dhRVql"><div data-scrollfwd="true" style="position:absolute;top:0"></div><div class="sc-e715a00b-0 cJmlTc"><h2 data-as="1" class="sc-54baf552-0 evXhp">Explore Web3</h2></div><div data-scrollbwd="true" style="position:absolute;bottom:0"></div></div></section></div><div class="sc-28f5918a-0 YOsfj"><div class="sc-28f5918a-1 eYFsxO"></div><div class="sc-28f5918a-2 bOGfnl"><div data-step="2" class="sc-e715a00b-0 cJmlTc"><section class="sc-3f11f36c-0 ZbmfO"><div data-scrollto="true"></div><div data-side-columns="true" class="sc-e53b9cc9-0 sc-2be76a8b-0 iQlomH jRBWrn"><div class="sc-3f11f36c-1 jyKnLJ"><h2 data-as="1" class="sc-54baf552-0 evXhp"><span class="sc-412f876f-0 sc-55348256-0 oHuZJ fXvBOV">One platform for your Web3 life</span></h2><p class="sc-30f98474-0 sc-d5c34dfb-0 jzhxoO dSxLBw">Lace brings together a wealth of Web3 features, from managing digital assets, to accessing NFTs, DApps, and DeFi services, so you can discover and enjoy a new world of digital experiences.</p><div style="margin-top:32px" class="sc-f6398f53-0 fUUkqb"></div></div><div class="sc-3f11f36c-2 wEENO"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1810" height="1220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:auto" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgallery.42c5b649.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></section></div><div data-step="3" class="sc-e715a00b-0 cJmlTc"><section class="sc-3f11f36c-0 ZbmfO"><div data-scrollto="true"></div><div data-side-columns="true" class="sc-e53b9cc9-0 sc-2be76a8b-0 iQlomH jRBWrn"><div class="sc-3f11f36c-1 jyKnLJ"><div class="sc-61bea5e-0 ittuZz"><h2 data-as="3" class="sc-54baf552-0 evXhp"><span class="sc-412f876f-0 sc-55348256-0 oHuZJ fXvBOV">Lace Mobile - Your <em class="sc-b79622d7-0 eSHIZj">wallet</em> on the go</span></h2><p class="sc-30f98474-0 sc-d5c34dfb-0 jzhxoO dSxLBw">Experience the power of Lace wherever you are, with multi-chain asset management - Cardano &amp; Bitcoin. Download now for full control on the go.</p><div data-type="badge" class="sc-885ee6ee-0 hVtJuM"><a href="https://play.google.com/store/