me":"Home","header.learn":"Learn","header.learn.overview":"Resources","header.learn.faq":"FAQ","header.learn.glossary":"Glossary","header.blog":"Blog","header.roadmap":"Roadmap","header.comingSoon.mobile":"Coming soon for mobile","footer.newsletter.cta":"Register now","footer.newsletter.body":"Sign up for Lace updates and news (including developer updates, customer research opportunities, blog notifications, and more).","footer.newsletter.headline":"Stay in the loop","footer.newsletter.emailLabel":"Enter email...","resultsCount_other":"{{count}} results","resultsCount_one":"{{count}} result","resultsCount_zero":"No results","back":"Back","readTime_one":"{{readTimeMinutes}} min read","readTime_other":"{{readTimeMinutes}} min read","laceBlogName":"Lace Blog","install.mobile_dialog_title":"Lace is almost ready to use!","install.mobile_dialog_content":"To activate your shiny new wallet, just head to your desktop browser menu and click Add in Manage Extensions.","install.mobile_dialog_close":"Got it!","banner.headline":"Lace 1.23 is here!","banner.headline.mobile":"Lace 1.23 is here!","banner.button.text":"Find out more","banner.button.link":"https://www.lace.io/blog/lace-1-23-1-release","footer.newsletter.disclaimer":"By checking this box, I agree to allow IOG to store and process the personal data submitted on this form in accordance with the IOG \u003ca href=\"/lace-privacy-policy.pdf\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e","install.installed.text":"Join our Discord","install.installed.url":"https://discord.com/invite/lace-1073034511664824360?utm_source=lace.io\u0026utm_medium=website\u0026utm_campaign=general\u0026utm_content=button","header.search":"Search","footer.working.groups.link":"https://discord.com/invite/lacewallet?utm_source=lace.io\u0026utm_medium=website\u0026utm_campaign=general\u0026utm_content=button","defi.newsletter.emailLabel":"Enter email","defi.newsletter.disclaimer":"By checking this box, I agree to allow IOG to store and process the personal data submitted on this form in accordance with the IOG \u003ca href=\"/lace-privacy-policy.pdf\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e","defi.newsletter.cta":"Submit","defi.header.event":"Stay Updated","defi.header.about":"About Lace","defi.header.partners":"Partners","banner.defi.headline":"Download Lace app to your mobile phone","banner.defi.headline.mobile":"Download Lace app to your mobile phone","banner.defi.button.link":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=io.lace.mobilewallet  ","defi.header.whitepaper":"Download whitepaper","header.laceid":"LaceID","install.japan.tour.mobile":"Download Lace","geolocation.banner.headline":"⚠ なりすましサイトにご注意ください 偽サイト:lacedesktop.io ⚠","geolocation.banner.headline.mobile":"なりすましサイトにご注意ください 偽サイト:lacedesktop.io ","geolocation.banner.text":"「Lace Desktop 2.0」を騙ったフィッシングメールも確認されています。\nリカバリーフレーズや秘密鍵をお聞きすることは絶対にありません！\u2028","geolocation.banner.button.label":"公式チャンネルのみご利用ください","geolocation.banner.fake.link":"lacedesktop.io","hero.headline.a":"Welcome to Lace, your Web3 home","hero.body.a":"Lace x Midnight: The claim phase of Glacier Drop is here, use your Lace wallet from IOG to claim the $NIGHT.","hero.headline.b":"The fast and easy way to explore Web3","hero.cta.desktop":"Add to browser","hero.cta.mobile":"Coming soon for mobile","hero.notSupported":"Sorry! We don’t support this browser yet. Lace currently supports Google Chrome.","hero.error":"Sorry! We don’t support this browser yet. Lace currently supports Google Chrome.","portal.headline":"Explore Web3","demo.cta.desktop":"Try the interactive demo","demo.cta.mobile":"Go to desktop for the interactive demo","features.overview.headline":"One platform for your Web3 life","features.overview.body":"Lace brings together a wealth of Web3 features, from managing digital assets, to accessing NFTs, DApps, and DeFi services, so you can discover and enjoy a new world of digital experiences.","features.mobile.headline":"Lace Mobile - Your \u003cEmphasize\u003ewallet\u003c/Emphasize\u003e on the go","features.mobile.body":"Experience the power of Lace wherever you are, with multi-chain asset management - Cardano \u0026 Bitcoin. Download now for full control on the go.","features.wallet.headline":"More than just a \u003cEmphasize\u003ewallet\u003c/Emphasize\u003e","features.wallet.body":"Securely send and receive digital assets, easily stake your ada and participate in the Cardano network, or send multiple assets to different addresses in one transaction. Lace does everything a wallet does – and more.","features.design.headline":"Designed for the \u003cEmphasize\u003eworld\u003c/Emphasize\u003e","features.design.body":"Lace is designed for everyone, everywhere. So now the whole world can explore Web3, effortlessly. ","features.dev.headline":"A bright \u003cEmphasize\u003efuture\u003c/Emphasize\u003e ahead","features.dev.body":"Lace is already evolving, with many new features in the pipeline. From a DApp Store, to a mobile app, digital identity solutions, and more – this is just the beginning.","hero.manageExtensions":"After installing to your desktop browser, don’t forget to click Add in Manage Extensions","features.dev.cta":"Explore features","blog.button.text":"Find out what's new","blog.button.link":"/blog","hero.body.text":"\u003chighlight\u003eLace x Midnight\u003c/highlight\u003e: The claim phase of Glacier Drop is here, use your Lace wallet from IOG to \u003chighlight\u003eClaim the $Night\u003c/highlight\u003e.","hero.body.lacexmidnight.text":"Built by Input Output, the team behind Cardano and Midnight, Lace gives you seamless, native access to both ecosystems and beyond. Manage public and shielded assets on your terms, with built-in learning tools to support you every step of the way."}}},"ns":"translations","locale":"en"},"__N_SSG":true},"page":"/","query":{},"buildId":"CiOho8qqApRfM5Pcfs-Vr","isFallback":false,"isExperimentalCompile":false,"gsp":true,"locale":"en","locales":["en"],"defaultLocale":"en","scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>